{"unit_id":"Yuuyuko-uu__dsh-speak-up#card-zh","repo":"Yuuyuko-uu/dsh-speak-up","commit":"e3bc6362208c693bb833ecf463ec6a20df4b6419","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"主动搭话（dsh-speak-up）是面向 DSH 网页端的主动开口插件。宿主按设定间隔在本地掷骰，结合安静时段、峰谷命中线、近期对话时机因子和连续未命中加成决定是否触发；命中后向一个已勾选且活跃的会话投递消息，由 DSH 按该会话原有的人格、历史、工具和记忆继续一轮。网页设置页可管理目标会话、配置触发文案、演练或手动发送，并查看最近记录。无需单独 API Key；模型调用使用 DSH 原有配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:682-821","lib/client.js:399-443"]}
{"unit_id":"Yuuyuko-uu__dsh-speak-up#card-en","repo":"Yuuyuko-uu/dsh-speak-up","commit":"e3bc6362208c693bb833ecf463ec6a20df4b6419","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Adds timed proactive turns to DSH web. A local roll applies quiet hours and timing thresholds. A hit prompts one selected active session using its existing context. The settings page manages targets and prompt text, supports rehearsal and manual sending, and shows activity. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host.js:682-821","lib/client.js:399-443"]}
